   5:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   * @brief   CMSIS Cortex-M4 Device Peripheral Access Layer System Source File.
   6:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
   7:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *   This file provides two functions and one global variable to be called from 
   8:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *   user application:
   9:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemInit(): This function is called at startup just after reset and 
  10:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                      before branch to main program. This call is made inside
  11:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                      the "startup_stm32f4xx.s" file.
  12:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  13:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClock variable: Contains the core clock (HCLK), it can be used
  14:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                  by the user application to setup the SysTick 
  15:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                  timer or configure other parameters.
  16:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                     
  17:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClockUpdate(): Updates the variable SystemCoreClock and must
  18:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                 be called whenever the core clock is changed
  19:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *                                 during program execution.
  20:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  21:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   *
  22:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/Src/system_stm32f4xx.c ****   ******************************************************************************
